        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Kikamarae Raba",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 20:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ani ekaru ŋol iceere, apaki ŋina aminatar ŋirwosi aŋaanar ŋajorei, abu Yoab toriko ŋasigarya akirem akwap a Ŋiamoni. Apotu ikes toloto kikamasi Raba. Nai edoŋit Daudi apaki ŋin Yerusalem, Yoab bon abu kisiiryak Ŋiamoni alo Raba kikama. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.20.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.20.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 20:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Tolacu Daudi ebokot ŋolo anapit Milikom. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.20.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.20.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20:2",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Milikom",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Arae Milikom akuj a Ŋiamoni",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Arae apotis a ebokot a ŋol ŋakiloi a egolid ŋuna eapiyarito ŋatomoniuni ka ŋaomwon, ido esibusitae ebokot ŋol a amoru a ŋina epol egyelit. Abu Daudi kiwuak amoru ŋin lobokot keŋ a elope. Abu Daudi yau tari ŋiboro ŋulu alalak nooi ŋulu aŋatuni iŋes alotaun a ŋol. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.20.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.20.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 20:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Toriku Daudi ŋituŋa a etaun a ŋol, inak ikes akitiya a ŋirigi, a ŋisururo ka a ŋaepe. Abu Daudi kitiya ŋakiro ŋun lotaunio a Ŋiamoni daadaŋ. Ani nai ekaku, apotu Daudi ka ŋasigarya keŋ daadaŋ toboŋosi Yerusalem.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.20.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.20.3"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Toŋaanak Daudi Ŋipilistin ŋajorei",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 20:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.20.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.20.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 20:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ekaku a ŋun, apotu Ŋipilistin kiiryakin ka Ŋisirael alo Geser; abu nai Sibecai ŋolo arae Eusasit toar Sipai ŋolo arae lopapait a Ŋirepai, ido apotu Ŋisirael tobwaŋa Ŋipilistin. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.20.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.20.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 20:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abu nabo ejie ece toyakaun kidiŋ Ŋipilistin ka Ŋisirael; abu Elanan lokoku a Yair toar Lami lokaato keŋ a Golias a ŋolo arae Egititait, ayakar Lami akwara ŋina ayai amorok ŋina atya ayokot a ŋimoŋin. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.20.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.20.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 20:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Alojie nabo ke ece, a ŋolo abu toyakaun Gas, ayai ekile ŋolo aburon nen, ŋolo aya ŋimoyo ŋikanikapei ŋinakan ka ŋinakeju, arae ŋimoyo keŋ daadaŋ ŋatomoniarei ka ŋiomwon. Arae iŋes daŋ lopapait a Ŋirepai. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.20.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.20.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 20:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ani itoŋoi ekile ŋol Ŋisirael, abu Yonasan lokoku a Simea, ŋolo arae lokaato a Daudi toar ekile ŋol. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.20.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.20.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 20:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Arae ŋikilyok ŋul ŋipapae a Ŋirepai a ŋulu alo Gas, apotu Daudi ka ŋikajiok keŋ toara ikes.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.20.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.20.8"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
